 character limit while covering all required topics\n\nNow I'll draft the post content following the existing Laksa post structure.","signature":""}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":8,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1050,"cache_read_input_tokens":63591,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1050},"output_tokens":1,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"9d69bad7-fd70-4f14-8ebe-891ae4eab84a","uuid":"3bf6e3ef-1665-4d6c-a6a8-35cbc1e211ea"}
{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-haiku-4-5-20251001","id":"msg_01YFJH2XrGh9S3qpWaDvDV6n","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"## Current State\n\nThe blog posts are stored in `site/src/data/blog/posts.ts` as an array of objects. The Laksa Johor post (US-267) was recently added. The file structure shows posts ending at line 1711, followed by the closing `};` array delimiter at line 1712.\n\n## Problem Identified\n\nNeed to add a new blog post for Mee Rebus Johor covering its history (1918 origins), Haji Wahid legacy, top stalls, and JB vs KL style comparison. Must meet acceptance criteria: slug, category, readTime, tags, content under 6000 characters, and npm build passing.\n\n## Planned Changes\n\n- Add new blog post object to `rawPosts` array in `site/src/data/blog/posts.ts` (before line 1712)\n- Post includes: slug, title, excerpt, category, readTime, date, tags, featured image, and HTML content\n- Content covers history, gravy notes, top 3 stalls with Haji Wahid reference, and JB vs KL comparison\n- Run `npm run build` to verify\n\n<plan>\n{\n  \"files_to_create\": [],\n  \"files_to_modify\": [\"site/src/data/blog/posts.ts\"],\n  \"functions_to_add\": [],\n  \"estimated_loc\": 100\n}\n</plan>\n\nNow let me read the full Laksa post structure to match the style:"}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":8,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1050,"cache_read_input_tokens":63591,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1050},"output_tokens":1,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"9d69bad7-fd70-4f14-8ebe-891ae4eab84a","uuid":"d7f7abdf-7483-4101-a712-039727e3d067"}
